.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Date-n-Time
@Contents
$# Date-n-Time v2.03#

    Version 2.03.
    This plugin was designed for using Date and Time in
  various formats. It can insert current date/time in
  any format to clipboard, edited text, command line.

    See about plugin:

  ~About plugin~@About@
  ~General menu~@Menu@
  ~Calendar~@Calendar@
  ~Configuration~@Config@
  ~Dialogs~@Dialogs@
  ~Format specifications~@Format@
  ~Dialog API~@API
  ~RegExp and text parsing~@Misc

  ~About Author~@Author
@Author
$# Some words about the Author and this plugin#

   If you find some bugs , please write me message about it.

 Semenov Alexey.
 E-mail: #griphon25@@hotmail.com#

 ~Back~@Contents

@About
$# About#
    Sometimes you want to insert current date or time to
  edited text. Or you want to create folder or archive with
  name using current date (for example to handle a project
  or source history). 
    Now, thanks to Eugene Roshal, you may use this plugin
  to do it.

  ~Back~@Contents

@Config
$# Configuration#

    You may configure all modes of this plugin by pressing
  F4 on chosen main menu plugin item.

    To read about configuration dialogs:
  
  ~Auto mode configuration~@AutoDialog
  ~Menu mode configuration~@MenuDialog
  ~Indicator configuration~@IndDialog
  ~Calendar configuration~@CalDialog

  ~Back~@Contents

@Dialogs
